      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b6b4e8cb1b04a6db0be465d|full_name}: The way stuff is played from youtube does not allow the videos to go over 720p, and for some videos, VRChat can only get even lower quality copies. It all depends on the video and when it was uploaded and the source video that was uploaded. And sometimes the channel if it's associated with Vevo or some other rights manager.\n\nSo this is not something that is easily fixable. I would take it off the list of things you would like fixed in this omnibus list of bugs you have here.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
