      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As far as stuttering goes, ask your crew to lose the dynamic bone, and to avoid switching avatars. Also, make sure the world is reasonably optimized too. Be careful with the real-time global illumination updates if you are using that. It's intensive.\n\nFrom my experience, the video player itself is not necessarily causing stutters and issues. It's likely everything else going on.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
